		'TREAT A DEFINED TERM, RECITAL FORMULA OR CITED DOCUMENT TITLE IN A CONTRACT, POLICY OR IMPRINT AS A FROZEN STRING — declared once, then repeated character for character, never re-lexicalised. Add nothing operative the source lacks: „may terminate for cause” must not gain „cu efect imediat”.',
		'MAP ONE ENGLISH RANK TO ONE ROMANIAN FORM SITEWIDE, NEVER CHANGING TIER. „Director general” already means CEO and is not a modifier meaning „chief”: CTO = „director de tehnologie (CTO)”, CFO = „director financiar (CFO)”, CEO / Managing Director = „director general”. Never build „director general de tehnologie”, a chimera that misstates a named person\'s rank.',
