		'NAME A UI ELEMENT BY ITS FUNCTION INSTEAD OF CALQUING THE LABEL WORD FOR WORD: „Chatbot input” is „Câmp de introducere a mesajului”, never „Intrare Chatbot”, because „intrare” means entrance.',
